er-g412","hunter-g492","hunter-g403","hunter-g76","hunter-g25","hunter-g472","hunter-g72","hunter-g451","hunter-g484"}}},title="Beast Mastery | WoW Forever Hunter Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[482]},{id="journey",x=S[315]},{id="talents",x=S[247]},{id="stats",x=S[350]},{id="combat",x=S[351]},{id="macros",x=S[352]},{id="dungeons",x=S[285]},{id="professions",x=S[316]},{id="crafting",x=S[302]},{id="questgear",x=S[276]},{id=S[243],x=S[432]}},asideNote="Researched 29 October 2026\nForever data only\n\nHover, focus or tap an item icon for its tooltip. Click to keep it open; Escape closes it.\n\nMain guide: 689 words.\nReference tables and tooltips are additional.",talentString="512022150510105130500520014",ranks={{tree="BM",name=S[339],r=5,max=5},{tree="BM",name=S[530],r=1,max=5},{tree="BM",name=S[666],r=2,max=2},{tree="BM",name=S[507],r=2,max=2},{tree="BM",name="Pathfinding",r=2,max=2},{tree="BM",name=S[559],r=1,max=1},{tree="BM",name=S[453],r=5,max=5},{tree="BM",name="Ferocity",r=5,max=5},{tree="BM",name="Summon Hawk",r=1,max=1},{tree="BM",name=S[531],r=1,max=1},{tree="BM",name="Frenzy",r=5,max=5},{tree="BM",name=S[483],r=1,max=1},{tree="MM",name="Hawk Eye",r=3,max=3},{tree="MM",name=S[210],r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name="Careful Aim",r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name=S[365],r=2,max=2},{tree="MM",name=S[366],r=1,max=1},{tree="MM",name=S[409],r=4,max=5}},order={{l1=10,l2=14,tree="BM",name=S[339],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=15,l2=16,tree="BM",name=S[666],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=17,l2=18,tree="BM",name=S[507],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=19,l2=19,tree="BM",name=S[530],r1=1,r2=1,max=5},{l1=20,l2=20,tree="BM",name=S[559],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=21,l2=22,tree="BM",name="Pathfinding",r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=23,l2=24,tree="BM",name=S[453],r1=1,r2=2,max=5},{l1=25,l2=25,tree="BM",name="Summon Hawk",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=26,l2=29,tree="BM",name="Ferocity",r1=1,r2=4,max=5},{l1=30,l2=30,tree="BM",name=S[531],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=31,l2=31,tree="BM",name="Ferocity",r1=5,r2=5,max=5},{l1=32,l2=34,tree="BM",name=S[453],r1=3,r2=5,max=5},{l1=35,l2=39,tree="BM",name="Frenzy",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="BM",name=S[483],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=41,l2=43,tree="MM",name="Hawk Eye",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=44,l2=45,tree="MM",name=S[210],r1=1,r2=2,max=5},{l1=46,l2=50,tree="MM",name="Careful Aim",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=51,l2=52,tree="MM",name=S[365],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=53,l2=55,tree="MM",name=S[210],r1=3,r2=5,max=5},{l1=56,l2=56,tree="MM",name=S[366],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=57,l2=60,tree="MM",name=S[409],r1=1,r2=4,max=5}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[277]},{t="p",s="legend",x="|cff71d5ffBlue text was updated for the WoW Forever hotfixes up to 10 November and is awaiting final review.|r"},{t="h1",x=S[644],sub=S[353]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Single-target PvE Beast Mastery: your pet and two hawks carry the damage while Deadly Aspects, Frenzy and Bestial Wrath keep the whole team fast, backed by Marksmanship crit and Trueshot Aura. Not built for PvP or AoE farming."},{t="pills",list={S[281],S[189],S[317]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[484]},{t="h2",x=S[214]},{t="p",x=S[49]},{t="p",s="level",x="1–19 · Pet foundations"},{t="p",x="Use ranged openings, train your pet at 10, and establish pet threat before spending mana. Deadly Aspects reaches 5/5 by level 14, Focused Fire 2/2 by 16, Improved Revive Pet 2/2 by 18 and Endurance Training 1/5 at 19. Fight one enemy at a time and keep pet food, ammunition and learned abilities current."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Hawks and pet damage"},{t="p",x="Bestial Swiftness arrives at 20 and Pathfinding is 2/2 by 22. Unleashed Fury is 2/5 by 24, Summon Hawk arrives at 25, Ferocity is 4/5 by 29, Intimidation arrives at 30, Ferocity finishes at 31 and Unleashed Fury at 34, and Frenzy is 5/5 by 39. Frenzy needs 25 points in Beast Mastery and a full Ferocity, so do not spend it earlier."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Marksmanship support"},{t="p",x="Bestial Wrath at 40 completes the 31-point Beast Mastery tree. The last twenty points go into Marksmanship: Hawk Eye 3/3 (41–43) for range, Lethal Attacks 5/5 (44–45 and 53–55) for crit, Careful Aim 5/5 (46–50), Rapid Killing 2/2 (51–52), Trueshot Aura at 56 for your party’s ranged attack power, and Mortal Shots 4/5 (57–60) for bigger ranged crits."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[248]},{t="h2",x=S[281]},{t="p",x="Tree order: Beast Mastery / Marksmanship / Survival. These 51 points are entered on the Standards.gg talent calculator and checked against the launch talent trees for totals, maximum ranks, tier gates and prerequisites. Changes made inside the calculator do not rewrite this guide."},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[286]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[233]},{t="p",x="Spend one point per level in each range. Unlisted talents stay at zero. This order has been checked for totals, maximum ranks, tier gates and prerequisites."},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="|cffffffffBuilt for single-target PvE.|r This allocation is tuned for one enemy at a time: questing elites, dungeon bosses and raid-style boss fights. It is not a PvP build and not an area-damage (AoE) farming build; it takes no Scatter Shot, Deterrence, Entrapment or Barrage, and the damage comes from your pet, hawks and a steady single-target shot rotation."},{t="p",s="notice",x="Trueshot Aura raises ranged attack power for your whole party, and Careful Aim turns your Intellect into attack power, so Intellect on gear is worth a little more in this build."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[354]},{t="h2",x=S[264]},{t="p",x="Your ranged weapon is your biggest upgrade. After that, Agility and attack power raise the damage of you and your shots, and Intellect turns into attack power through Careful Aim."},{t="h3",x=S[454]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[471],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Agility",x=S[244]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=S[253]},{t="p",s="small",x="Strength only helps melee attacks, so it is a low priority. Melee weapons matter only for their Agility and attack power."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[367],x=S[340]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Hit chance",x="to 8%"},{t="stat",i=3,b=S[433],x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Agility",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[532],x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Some estimates put the hit target at 9%. Intellect still has value through Careful Aim and your mana pool."},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[55]},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[265]},{t="h2",x=S[455]},{t="p",x=S[57]},{t="h4",x="Prepare the pull"},{t="p",x="Use Aspect of the Hawk, mark the target and send your pet first. With Aspect of the Hawk active, Deadly Aspects gives Auto Shot a 10% chance to raise your ranged attack speed by 30% for 12 seconds, so keep Auto Shot running. From 56, keep Trueshot Aura active for your party."},{t="h4",x="Maintain pet and hawk uptime"},{t="p",x="Keep up to two hawks attacking durable targets (Summon Hawk keeps attacking for 18 seconds and shares its cooldown with Arcane Shot|cff71d5ff; it and Arcane Shot cost 11% of your base Mana at every rank|r). Unleashed Fury adds 15% to pet and hawk damage and Ferocity adds 10% crit, while Frenzy gives your pet a 30% attack speed boost for 8 seconds after each crit. Use Bestial Wrath (+50% pet damage for 18 seconds) when the pet can attack throughout the window."},{t="h4",x="Choose shots for one target"},{t="p",x="Use Serpent Sting when the target will survive enough ticks, and Aimed Shot as your single-target starting choice. Use Arcane Shot selectively when it will not delay useful Hawk uptime. You do not need Multi-Shot for this build; keep your attention on the target your pet is fighting."},{t="h4",x="Protect the pet and your mana"},{t="p",x="Focused Fire gives you and your pet 2% more damage while the pet is active, so a dead pet costs more than its own damage. Mend Pet early enough to prevent a death, and use Intimidation to stun the target on your pet's next attack (with +100% crit chance) for control and threat. Bestial Discipline lets 50% of your mana regeneration continue while casting. Traps and Feign Death are your emergency tools."},{t="h4",x=S[303]},{t="p",x="This build is for questing elites, dungeon bosses and boss fights, not for PvP or for farming packs. In groups, leave pack damage to others and keep your pet, hawks and shots on your boss target."},{t="abil",names={"Summon Hawk",S[483],S[531],"Aimed Shot","Arcane Shot",S[485],S[486],S[487],"Feign Death"}},{t="h3",x=S[378]},{t="p",x="Compare damage range, weapon speed, useful stats, requirements and your actual equipped item. Ranged-only bonuses do not improve melee attacks. Agility remains useful; this build also invests in Careful Aim (2/5), which turns Intellect into Attack Power, and Surefooted gives 3% hit. Do not apply a generic hit number to every encounter or attack type: check the current rules for your target and weapons before removing Surefooted."},{t="p",x=S[46]},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[326]},{t="h2",x=S[327]},{t="p",x=S[45]},{t="p",x=S[36]},{t="macro",n=S[208],x=S[70],code=S[154]},{t="macro",n=S[266],x=S[75],code=S[135]},{t="macro",n=S[488],x=S[67],code=S[278]},{t="macro",n=S[434],x=S[97],code=S[304]},{t="macro",n="Mend Pet",x=S[89],code=S[150]},{t="macro",n=S[225],x=S[60],code=S[102]},{t="macro",n=S[226],x=S[61],code=S[109]},{t="macro",n="Wing Clip",x=S[78],code=S[112]},{t="macro",n="Bestial Wrath and pet attack",x="Requires the selected Bestial Wrath talent and a usable pet. Sends your pet at your target as you activate the cooldown.",code="#showtooltip Bestial Wrath\n/petattack [harm,nodead]\n/cast [harm,nodead] Bestial Wrath"},{t="macro",n="Intimidation and pet attack",x="Requires Intimidation. Direct your pet at the enemy you want it to stun; do not use this on a target you intend to keep trapped.",code="#showtooltip Intimidation\n/petattack [harm,nodead]\n/cast [harm,nodead] Intimidation"},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[435]},{t="h2",x=S[234]},{t="p",x=S[42]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[51]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[267]},{t="h2",x=S[227]},{t="p",x=S[44]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[287]},{t="h2",x=S[215]},{t="p",x=S[40]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[268]},{t="h2",x=S[201]},{t="p",x=S[41]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[243]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[58]}}},{id="marksmanship",name=S[667],token="MM",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-hunter-2","st-hunter-1","hunter-g123","hunter-g89","hunter-g94","hunter-g69","hunter-g87","hunter-g12","hunter-g99","hunter-g11","hunter-g32","hunter-g41","hunter-g65","hunter-g70","hunter-g117","hunter-g59","hunter-g128","hunter-g18","hunter-g125","hunter-g39","hunter-g131","hunter-g102","hunter-g115","hunter-g17","hunter-g0","hunter-g2","hunter-g77","hunter-g88","hunter-g5","hunter-g8","hunter-g23","hunter-g79","hunter-g108","hunter-g14","hunter-g53","hunter-g13","hunter-g66","hunter-g71","hunter-g100","hunter-g114","hunter-g49","hunter-g63","hunter-g111","hunter-g113","hunter-g116","hunter-g35","hunter-g80","hunter-g130","hunter-g124","hunter-g40","hunter-g43","hunter-g127","hunter-g129","hunter-g92","hunter-g83","hunter-g91","hunter-g119","hunter-g37","hunter-g75","hunter-g101","hunter-g52","hunter-g97","hunter-g34","hunter-g126","hunter-g24","hunter-g67","hunter-g84","hunter-g85","hunter-g73","hunter-g107","hunter-g297","hunter-g20","hunter-g302","hunter-g303","hunter-g306","hunter-g93","hunter-g310","hunter-g103","hunter-g122","hunter-g33","hunter-g57","hunter-g58","hunter-g98","hunter-g3","hunter-g21","hunter-g56","hunter-g74","hunter-g9","hunter-g81","hunter-g38","hunter-g82","hunter-g47","hunter-g104","h