nter-g353","hunter-g379","hunter-g105","hunter-g390","hunter-g386","hunter-g81","hunter-g362","hunter-g380","hunter-g56","hunter-g388","hunter-g349","hunter-g357","hunter-g29","hunter-g110","hunter-g383"}},{b="50-60",no="Best match per slot for Marksmanship by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"hunter-g433","hunter-g485","hunter-g121","hunter-g467","hunter-g490","hunter-g486","hunter-g489","hunter-g120","hunter-g51","hunter-g412","hunter-g492","hunter-g403","hunter-g76","hunter-g25","hunter-g472","hunter-g72","hunter-g451","hunter-g484"}}},title="Marksmanship | WoW Forever Hunter Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[482]},{id="journey",x=S[315]},{id="talents",x=S[247]},{id="stats",x=S[350]},{id="combat",x=S[351]},{id="macros",x=S[352]},{id="dungeons",x=S[285]},{id="professions",x=S[316]},{id="crafting",x=S[302]},{id="questgear",x=S[276]},{id=S[243],x=S[432]}},asideNote="Researched 29 October 2026\nForever data only\n\nHover, focus or tap an item icon for its tooltip. Click to keep it open; Escape closes it.\n\nMain guide: 721 words.\nReference tables and tooltips are additional.",talentString="0000000000000000005355201152305150005003",ranks={{tree="MM",name=S[210],r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name=S[589],r=3,max=3},{tree="MM",name="Efficiency",r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name="Careful Aim",r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name=S[365],r=2,max=2},{tree="MM",name="Lone Wolf",r=1,max=1},{tree="MM",name=S[366],r=1,max=1},{tree="MM",name=S[409],r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name=S[533],r=2,max=2},{tree="MM",name="Barrage",r=3,max=3},{tree="MM",name=S[341],r=5,max=5},{tree="MM",name="Sniper Shot",r=1,max=1},{tree="SV",name=S[298],r=5,max=5},{tree="SV",name="Survivalist",r=5,max=5},{tree="SV",name="Surefooted",r=3,max=3}},order={{l1=10,l2=14,tree="MM",name=S[210],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=15,l2=19,tree="MM",name="Careful Aim",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=20,l2=21,tree="MM",name=S[365],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=22,l2=24,tree="MM",name=S[589],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=25,l2=29,tree="MM",name=S[409],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=30,l2=30,tree="MM",name=S[366],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=31,l2=33,tree="MM",name="Barrage",r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=34,l2=34,tree="MM",name="Lone Wolf",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=35,l2=39,tree="MM",name=S[341],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="MM",name="Sniper Shot",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=41,l2=45,tree="MM",name="Efficiency",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=46,l2=47,tree="MM",name=S[533],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=48,l2=52,tree="SV",name=S[298],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=53,l2=57,tree="SV",name="Survivalist",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=58,l2=60,tree="SV",name="Surefooted",r1=1,r2=3,max=3}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[277]},{t="h1",x=S[667],sub=S[353]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Single-target PvE Marksmanship: a petless ranged build that stacks Lone Wolf, Careful Aim, Mortal Shots and Ranged Weapon Specialization on one target at a time, with Survival hit and health support. Not built for PvP or AoE farming."},{t="pills",list={S[430],S[189],S[317]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[484]},{t="h2",x=S[214]},{t="p",x=S[49]},{t="p",s="level",x="1–19 · Learn the shooting core"},{t="p",x="Lethal Attacks reaches 5/5 by level 14 and Careful Aim 5/5 by 19. A pet remains useful while leveling even though the final build contains Lone Wolf, so train pet skills, maintain ammunition and use a strong ranged weapon."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Build ranged damage"},{t="p",x="Aimed Shot is trained at 20. Rapid Killing is 2/2 by 21, Improved Stings 3/3 by 24, Mortal Shots 5/5 by 29, Trueshot Aura arrives at 30 and Barrage is 3/3 by 33. Lone Wolf is taken at 34 and Ranged Weapon Specialization is 5/5 by 39. Lone Wolf only pays off without an active pet, so keep your leveling pet until you switch to petless play."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Finish Marksmanship, then Survival"},{t="p",x="Sniper Shot at 40 completes the 31-point core. The last twenty points finish Marksmanship (Efficiency 5/5 by 45, Rapid Recuperation 2/2 by 47), then add Survival support: Improved Tracking, Survivalist and Surefooted (48–60). This build has no Beast Mastery points, so there is no Deadly Aspects or pet damage package."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[248]},{t="h2",x=S[430]},{t="p",x=S[64]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[286]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[233]},{t="p",x="Spend one point per level in each range. Unlisted talents stay at zero. This sequence has been checked against the calculator for totals, maximum ranks, tier gates and named prerequisites. After Sniper Shot at 40, the last twenty points finish Marksmanship first, then add Survival."},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="|cffffffffBuilt for single-target PvE.|r This allocation is tuned for one enemy at a time: questing elites, dungeon bosses and raid-style boss fights. It is not a PvP build and not an area-damage (AoE) farming build; it takes no Scatter Shot, Deterrence, Entrapment or other control talents, and the damage comes from steady single-target ranged shots."},{t="p",s="notice",x="For Beast Mastery and Marksmanship, 5/5 Survivalist and 3/3 Surefooted are flexible once your character is hit capped from other sources and raids are on farm. Remove Surefooted only if you remain hit capped without its bonus; remove Survivalist only when you can comfortably give up its extra health. Reallocate the freed points to damage, mana efficiency or utility that suits your playstyle. Preserve tier requirements and prerequisites: removing Survivalist also changes access to deeper Survival talents, so recalculate the entire build rather than moving isolated points."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[354]},{t="h2",x=S[264]},{t="p",x="Marksmanship lives on its ranged weapon: Aimed Shot and your other shots all scale with weapon damage. Agility and attack power come next, with Intellect adding attack power through Careful Aim."},{t="h3",x=S[454]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[471],x=""},{t="stat",i=2,b="Agility",x=S[244]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Stamina",x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x=S[253]},{t="p",s="small",x="Strength only helps melee attacks, so it is a low priority for this ranged build."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[367],x=S[340]},{t="stat",i=2,b="Hit chance",x="to 8%"},{t="stat",i=3,b=S[433],x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Agility",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b=S[532],x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Some estimates put the hit target at 9%. Critical strike is the most valuable secondary stat after hit."},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[55]},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[265]},{t="h2",x=S[455]},{t="p",x=S[57]},{t="h4",x="Prepare the petless setup"},{t="p",x="Dismiss your pet to activate Lone Wolf, which gives you 20% increased damage with all attacks while you have no active pet. Use Aspect of the Hawk, Trueshot Aura (extra ranged attack power for your party), the appropriate tracking for Improved Tracking, mark the target and maintain Auto Shot. Solo leveling can still use a pet, with Lone Wolf inactive."},{t="h4",x="Use Aimed Shot as your main shot"},{t="p",x="Careful Aim turns 100% of your Intellect into Attack Power, Lethal Attacks adds 5% crit, Mortal Shots raises ranged critical damage by 30% and Ranged Weapon Specialization adds 5% ranged damage. Barrage adds 15% to Aimed Shot, so Aimed Shot is your single-target core. You do not need Multi-Shot for this build."},{t="h4",x="Fit Sniper Shot into safe windows"},{t="p",x="Sniper Shot has a four-second cast and a 15-second cooldown, adds bonus damage and increases the range of your next 3 Shots by 10 yards for 10 seconds. Use it where movement and mana allow a useful cast; it is not an execute. Exact endgame priority remains provisional."},{t="h4",x="Use Sting and recovery deliberately"},{t="p",x="Apply Serpent Sting on suitable targets (Improved Stings adds 20% damage). Rapid Killing raises your next Shot by 20% within 20 seconds after you kill an enemy that carries your Sting, and Rapid Recuperation lets 50% of your mana regeneration continue while casting, or 100% once Rapid Killing is consumed. Kill-triggered benefits are not repeatedly available on one isolated boss."},{t="h4",x="Spend mana intelligently"},{t="p",x="Efficiency cuts the mana cost of your Shots, Stings and melee abilities by 15%. Arcane Shot is optional filler. Use Rapid Fire during a useful sustained attack window. Reduce low-value casts when their mana cost creates excessive drinking time."},{t="h4",x=S[303]},{t="p",x="This build is for questing elites, dungeon bosses and boss fights, not for PvP or for farming packs. In groups, leave pack damage to others and keep your shots on your boss target."},{t="abil",names={"Sniper Shot","Aimed Shot","Arcane Shot",S[485],S[486],S[487],"Feign Death"}},{t="h3",x=S[378]},{t="p",x="Compare damage range, weapon speed, useful stats, requirements and your actual equipped item. Ranged-only bonuses do not improve melee attacks. Agility remains useful; this build also invests in Careful Aim (5/5), which turns Intellect into Attack Power, and Surefooted gives 3% hit. Do not apply a generic hit number to every encounter or attack type: check the current rules for your target and weapons before removing Surefooted."},{t="p",x=S[46]},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[326]},{t="h2",x=S[327]},{t="p",x=S[45]},{t="p",x=S[36]},{t="macro",n=S[208],x=S[70],code=S[154]},{t="macro",n=S[266],x=S[75],code=S[135]},{t="macro",n=S[488],x=S[67],code=S[278]},{t="macro",n=S[434],x=S[97],code=S[304]},{t="macro",n="Mend Pet",x=S[89],code=S[150]},{t="macro",n=S[225],x=S[60],code=S[102]},{t="macro",n=S[226],x=S[61],code=S[109]},{t="macro",n="Wing Clip",x=S[78],code=S[112]},{t="macro",n="Sniper Shot",x="Requires the selected Sniper Shot talent. Keeps the shot on its own bind so you decide when to use it; pet commands are omitted for Lone Wolf.",code="#showtooltip Sniper Shot\n/cast [harm,nodead] Sniper Shot"},{t="macro",n="Aimed Shot / Shift: Multi-Shot",x="Hold Shift to choose Multi-Shot; otherwise use Aimed Shot. This selects one ability, not a sequence. Check nearby enemies before choosing an attack that hits multiple targets.",code="#showtooltip\n/cast [mod:shift,harm,nodead] Multi-Shot; [harm,nodead] Aimed Shot"},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[435]},{t="h2",x=S[234]},{t="p",x=S[42]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[51]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[267]},{t="h2",x=S[227]},{t="p",x=S[44]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[287]},{t="h2",x=S[215]},{t="p",x=S[40]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[268]},{t="h2",x=S[201]},{t="p",x=S[41]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[243]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[58]}}},{id="survival",name="Survival",token="SV",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-hunter-2","st-hunter-1","hunter-g123","hunter-g89","hunter-g94","hunter-g69","hunter-g87","hunter-g12","hunter-g99","hunter-g11","hunter-g32","hunter-g41","hunter-g65","hunter-g70","hunter-g117","hunter-g59","hunter-g18","hunter-g125","hunter-g39","hunter-g131","hunter-g102","hunter-g115","hunter-g17","hunter-g54","hunter-g0","hunter-g2","hunter-g77","hunter-g88","hunter-g5","hunter-g8","hunter-g23","hunter-g79","hunter-g108","hunter-g14","hunter-g53","hunter-g13","hunter-g66","hunter-g100","hunter-g114","hunter-g49","hunter-g63","hunter-g111","hunter-g113","hunter-g116","hunter-g35","hunter-g46","hunter-g80","hunter-g130","hunter-g124","hunter-g40","hunter-g43","hunter-g127","hunter-g129","hunter-g92","hunter-g83","hunter-g91","hunter-g119","hunter-g37","hunter-g75","hunter-g101","hunter-g52","hunter-g97","hunter-g34","hunter-g126","hunter-g24","hunter-g67","h